      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "USceneCaptureComponent*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Returns whether a scene capture doesn't want or need lighting, and can disable several additional rendering features to save performance\n(see DisableFeaturesForUnlit in ShowFlags.h).  Depth or base pass outputs aren't affected by lighting, while SceneColor outputs may be generated\nwith the Lighting flag disabled by the user.  FinalColor requires post processing, and so is assumed to require additional features, and can't\ntake advantage of disabling features for unlit."
    },
